# Xcode's own SPM dependency-resolution lockfile (Package.resolved) —
# regenerated by Xcode whenever it opens Runner.xcodeproj (pins the
# Firebase iOS SDK's transitive SPM deps). Same call as pubspec.lock just
# above: not committed for this app.
